I experienced a similar problem with my dm-1701 where I could not activate an FM repeater when using 5w, but could active using lower lower levels.<br><br>However the problem was not repeatable, i.e when I checked the power output using a power metre it was correct, and I was also able to activate the repeater.<br><br>My initial suspicion was that perhaps the output becomes distorted when using 5w, but as the problem was not repeatable, I could not do further test to try to understand why the problem happened at all<br><br>BTW.  IMO this problem won't be related to the CPU type, and is more likely to be related to power setting and battery voltage<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Mar 20, 2025 10:03 am</p><hr />
